# ==============================================================================
# 🎨 2. 3D ANIMATION & BLENDER CODING STANDARDS
# ==============================================================================
# When writing or modifying Blender Python scripts (wolfpack_shuffle_addon.py):
# 1. API COMPATIBILITY:
#    - Target Blender 4.0+ and 5.2+ API exclusively.
#    - Do NOT use deprecated Blender 2.7x/2.8x methods.
#    - UI Panels MUST inherit bpy.types.Panel and implement draw(self, context).
#    - Operators MUST inherit bpy.types.Operator and return {'FINISHED'}.
#    - Color management: Use AgX / Standard, sRGB transfer functions.
# 2. BROADCAST SANDWICH TYPOGRAPHY ARCHITECTURE:
#    - Keep typography locked to the camera-normal pitch plane (angle ~61.74°).
#    - Maintain three vertical strata:
#      * Top Eyebrow/Kicker: +Y = +0.58m, Scale 0.46
#      * Center Hero: Y = 0.00m, Scale 0.68
#      * Bottom Sponsor: -Y = -0.58m, Scale 0.38
#    - Maintain minimum 0.26 screen-height vertical gap to prevent camera perspective overlap.
# 3. BALANCED CENTERED EXITS:
#    - All exit animations (BURST_FORWARD, CENTER_IMPLODE, DROP_DOWN, LIFT_UP) must lock X=0.0 and rot_z=0.0°.
#    - Never introduce unprompted asymmetric rightward tilt/drift.
# 4. BRAND COLORS & LED RESTRICTIONS:
#    - Laurier Gold: #FDB913 (0.992, 0.725, 0.075) with 0.22 subtle emission.
#    - Laurier Deep Purple: #20003B (0.125, 0.000, 0.231) for backing strokes/bevels.
#    - APL Rule: NO pure white outlines on stadium jumbotrons to prevent diode auto-dimming.

# ==============================================================================
# 💻 3. WEB & SOFTWARE ENGINEERING STANDARDS
# ==============================================================================
# For StudyOS, CAPTAIN-FUNDS, or full-stack web development:
# 1. TypeScript Strictness: Never use 'any'. Explicit interfaces and types everywhere.
# 2. Architecture: Maintain MVC / Clean Architecture boundaries.
# 3. Security: JWT in HTTP-only cookies, bcrypt password hashing, RBAC verification.
# 4. State Management: Zustand for client state, Prisma for ORM data queries.

# ==============================================================================
# 📝 4. DOCUMENTATION & INTERLINKING PROTOCOL
