# 1. Always use bidirectional markdown links when referencing vault files:
#    - Standard Markdown: [Title](relative/path/to/file.md)
#    - Obsidian Wiki-Links: [[path/to/file|Title]]
# 2. Preserve all existing docstrings, comments, and changelog histories.
